omain":"arxiv.org","ref_id":"turn0academia24","snippet":"Oracle bone inscriptions(OBI) is the earliest developed writing system in China, bearing invaluable written exemplifications of early Shang history and paleography. ... This dataset can","title":"Oracle Bone Inscriptions Multi-modal Dataset","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.03900"},{"type":"text_result","domain":"zh.wikipedia.org","ref_id":"turn0search25","snippet":"口部為漢字索引中的部首之一，通稱口字旁，計三畫，是康熙字典214個部首中的第30個（三畫的中為第1個）。 ... * 漢語：口部（拼音：kǒubù，注音：ㄎㄡˇ ㄅㄨˋ）、口字旁","title":"口部 (部首)","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8F%A3%E9%83%A8_%28%E9%83%A8%E9%A6%96%29"}]}}
