{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"evidence\":[{\"source\":\"漢語多功能字庫 (CUHK)\",\"field\":\"形義通解；《廣韻》及中古音表\",\"text\":\"The entry analyzes 吧 as semantic 口 plus phonetic 巴. It lists two Guangyun fanqie entries, 普巴 and 伯加, classified respectively as 滂 and 幫 initials; both have level tone, 麻 rhyme, open division II. These classifications concern distinct entries and do not establish a date or sequence for the graph 吧.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E5%90%A7\",\"title\":\"漢語多功能字庫 — 字頭「吧」\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"漢語多功能字庫 (CUHK)\",\"field\":\"形義通解；近代漢語用例\",\"text\":\"The entry lists agreement, suggestion/imperative, conjectural/question, pause and conditional functions for particle 吧. Separately, it cites an onomatopoeic occurrence in chapter 15 of 兒女英雄傳, where a cup is set down with a 吧 sound. The entry does not date that use precisely or establish a connection to the particle.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E5%90%A7\",\"title\":\"漢語多功能字庫 — 字頭「吧」\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"孟繁杰、李焱，《从满汉合璧文献看语气词“啊、吧、吗、呢”的出现时间》, 古汉语研究 2022年第3期\",\"field\":\"pp.27–29; review of particle analyses and dated spellings\",\"text\":\"The authors summarize competing accounts of sentence-final 罢, including ellipsis from 便罢/也罢 and development from predicative 罢. They question whether a cited Yuan example is still verbal, note doubts about proposed Ming 吧 examples from 型世言, and report four particle 吧 occurrences in 1766 清语易言 as the earliest verifiable example in their survey. These are secondary reports about particle spellings and uses, not the formation date of graph 吧.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"secondary_research\",\"url\":\"https://www.scribd.com/document/1048360036/%E4%BB%8E%E6%BB%A1%E6%B1%89%E5%90%88%E7%92%A7%E6%96%87%E7%8C%AE%E7%9C%8B%E8%AF%AD%E6%B0%94%E8%AF%8D%E5%95%8A-%E5%90%A7-%E5%90%97-%E5%91%A2-%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4\",\"title\":\"从满汉合璧文献看语气词啊、吧、吗、呢的出现时间\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"University of Venice hosted IACL paper\",\"field\":\"PDF pp.216–224, especially pp.216–217 and 222–224\",\"text\":\"The paper distinguishes imperative 吧1 from conjectural/assertive 吧2. It reports 吧2 by the mid-eighteenth century, citing 1730 and 1740 sources written with 罢; says 吧 spelling appeared in the eighteenth century and became fixed from the late Qing; and argues 吧2 developed through contraction of sentence-final 不是 while 吧1 derives from 罢. The author treats their later written conflation as having no semantic-development relation. This is an attributed hypothesis, not an established universal derivation.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"scholarly_research\",\"url\":\"https://www.unive.it/web/fileadmin/user_upload/eventi/IACL-31/doc/BoAs_IACL_final.pdf\",\"title\":\"Microsoft Word — BoAs IACL_draft1.docx (PDF)\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"CUHK Multi-function Chinese Character Database\",\"field\":\"《說文》, 《廣韻》 and 形義通解 for 巴\",\"text\":\"The entry transmits the received Shuowen account that 巴 is 蟲 and the alternative that it is an elephant-eating snake; it labels displayed forms as oracle-bone, small-seal and other categories, and lists 巴’s 伯加 fanqie with Middle Chinese 幫 initial, level tone, 麻 rhyme, open division II. Its later glosses include waiting/hope and approach, but do not demonstrate a semantic chain. The classifications and received account do not settle the identity or chronology of ancient forms.\",\"record_character\":\"巴\",\"kind\":\"dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E5%B7%B4\",\"title\":\"漢語多功能字庫 — 字頭「巴」\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"江柏毅, CASE 報科學, National Taiwan University hosted article\",\"field\":\"巴 paleographic identification dispute\",\"text\":\"Search surfaced the article’s account of competing identifications of oracle-bone graphs formerly read as 巴 and the author’s seated-person interpretation. The article page could not be opened in this invocation, so this is a search lead only and is not direct article evidence.\",\"record_character\":\"巴\",\"kind\":\"search_result_only\",\"url\":\"https://case.ntu.edu.tw/blog/?p=45051\",\"title\":\"曾被釋為「巴」的甲骨文字與《說文解字》裡的「巴蛇食象」\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"教育部《國語辭典簡編本》2021\",\"field\":\"酒吧 entry\",\"text\":\"The dictionary gives 酒吧 as a current word, provides its pronunciation, describes the establishment and marks the English equivalent as bar. This supports current use of 吧 in the loanword 酒吧, but gives no borrowing date or historical source pronunciation.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"official_dictionary_entry\",\"url\":\"https://dict.concised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=22627&la=0&powerMode=0\",\"title\":\"酒吧 — 教育部《國語辭典簡編本》\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"pipeline/data/unihan-kmandarin-hsk1.tsv (project extract of Unicode Unihan 17.0.0)\",\"field\":\"kMandarin exact local rows U+53E3, U+5427 and U+5DF4\",\"text\":\"Checked supplied local rows: 口 kǒu, 吧 ba, 巴 bā. These are modern Mandarin metadata only. Unicode’s per-character lookup pages for U+5427 and U+5DF4 were attempted but inaccessible in the web reader; this local source is provenance, not an external click-through record.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"local_primary_reading_data\",\"url\":\"https://www.unicode.org/cgi-bin/GetUnihanData.pl?codepoint=5427\",\"title\":\"Unihan lookup for U+5427\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李學勤主編，《字源》 (2012), 天津古籍出版社／辽宁人民出版社, ISBN 9787552800692; PDF scan\",\"field\":\"PDF p.106, printed p.94; direct original-scan pixel inspection\",\"text\":\"The page is in 口部 and includes entries such as 吝、各、否. The visible occurrence 吧 is inside the OCR-derived quotation translating the 各 example (“王在辛日来，王不会有灾祸吧？”); it is not a headword or component and does not support an etymological claim about 吧. The printed page number 94 is visible in the scan.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"local_book_scan_inspection\",\"url\":\"https://www.worldcat.org/search?q=9787552800692\",\"title\":\"字源\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李學勤主編，《字源》 (2012), 天津古籍出版社／辽宁人民出版社, ISBN 9787552800692; PDF scan\",\"field\":\"PDF p.432, printed p.420; direct original-scan pixel inspection\",\"text\":\"The page contains the end of 寧 and the 可 entry, followed by 奇. The occurrence 吧 is in a modern Chinese rendering quoted inside the 寧 passage, not a headword or component. It supplies no claim about 吧. Printed page 420 is visible in the scan.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"local_book_scan_inspection\",\"url\":\"https://www.worldcat.org/search?q=9787552800692\",\"title\":\"字源\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"李學勤主編，《字源》 (2012), 天津古籍出版社／辽宁人民出版社, ISBN 9787552800692; PDF scan\",\"field\":\"PDF p.446, printed p.434; direct original-scan pixel inspection\",\"text\":\"The page contains entries in 虍部, including 虞 and 䖒; there is no 吧 headword. The OCR candidate is unrelated. Printed page 434 is visible in the scan.\",\"record_character\":\"吧\",\"kind\":\"local_book_scan_inspection\",\"url\":\"https://www.worldcat.org/search?q=9787552800692\",\"title\":\"字源\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"}],\"search_audit\":[{\"query\":\"吧 character 口 巴 phonetic CUHK 漢語多功能字庫; 吧 语气词 1776 清语易言 不是 罢 历史研究; 巴 oracle bone character origin seated person snake paleography research\",\"urls\":[\"https://humanum.arts.cuhk.edu.hk/Lexis/lexi-mf/search.php?word=%E5%90%A7\",\"https://www.scribd.com/document/1048360036/%E4%BB%8E%E6%BB%A1%E6%B1%89%E5%90%88%E7%92%A7%E6%96%87%E7%8C%AE%E7%9C%8B%E8%AF%AD%E6%B0%94%E8%AF%8D%E5%95%8A-%E5%90%A7-%E5%90%97-%E5%91%A2-%E7%9A%84%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4\",\"https://case.ntu.edu.tw/blog/?p=45051\",\"https://ctext.org/dic